{"id":"1381f44d-0a31-4b9e-bd14-97ed0aae096f","content":"<!-- suite-unico:start -->\n## La suite Unico (mediatori creditizi)\n\nQuesta app fa parte di una suite che condivide il database `core` e la libreria `meo-icar\/unico-core`:\n\n- **unicoagent**: preventivi e perfezionamento delle pratiche. App separata che parla con i vari CRM solo via API (gateway in `app\/Services\/Crm`: unicofinance, Mediafacile, REST generico).\n- **unicofinance**: CRM e istruttoria (pratiche, clienti, documenti, agenti, istruttori; pannelli admin e agenti). Espone le API per unicoagent (`\/api\/agente\/v1`, token e firma) e per unicobpm (`\/api`, chiave `X-Api-Key`).\n- **unicocoge** (ex Proforma): interfaccia COGE e contributi: provvigioni, proforma, fatture, prima nota.\n- **unicooam**: compliance e organigramma (Dipendenti con i ruoli in `employee_roles`, documenti e scadenziario, OAM\/IVASS, audit). I ruoli della suite si definiscono qui.\n- **unicobpm**: BPM e coordinatore. Processi con RACI che chiamano via API le altre app (`config\/services","embedding":[-0.0036402224,0.031976447,0.0113768475,0.0032022777,-0.0065760994,-0.0051519223,0.0068928404,0.0034571446,0.012480166,-0.049961533,-0.0051034912,0.021751286,0.0028829935,0.011752763,0.030034477,-0.017747866,0.005022903,-0.014177343,-0.008523964,0.0017776133,-0.024993818,-0.013659368,0.021616304,0.013299471,-0.0018900587,0.023920696,0.005468406,-0.015483564,-0.03691502,0.12544747,0.021401048,-0.009886706,-0.0053513143,-0.0075782556,0.003225689,0.0042015156,-0.022574829,0.024474317,0.0035193781,-0.0088609895,0.0031592092,0.006566173,0.0030185196,0.006413287,0.028395792,0.006200558,-0.0039552758,-0.0040811305,0.006494124,-0.0047323615,0.020626687,0.009684003,-0.015826369,-0.008102442,0.0006662367,-0.0075855893,-0.012711857,-0.007084082,-0.0021661196,0.016347373,0.0089242635,0.0011161689,0.0001405245,0.02027821,-0.018168548,-0.0057601836,0.016696775,-0.008120887,0.01571688,-0.0056729526,-0.0014274273,0.02257145,0.00020567537,0.0098074