{"id":"4ef0a77d-71c8-4ceb-80f4-4174b6306f1c","content":"php`, `apps`) e reagiscono a eventi esterni.\n- **unico-core**: libreria comune per schema condiviso, documenti, email, firma, accesso e bridge `\/api\/commands`.\n- Fuori da questo contesto, da non toccare: unicogdpr, ShareSync, backups3.\n\nRegole valide in tutte le app:\n- Lo schema condiviso si cambia solo in unico-core (migration con `unico-core:migrate`, protette da `hasTable`\/`hasColumn`); le app non alterano a mano le tabelle del core. Id sempre interi.\n- Istruttore = dipendente con il ruolo `istruttore` in `employee_roles`, come nell'organigramma di unicooam (in unicofinance: `App\\Support\\Istruttori`).\n- Gli stati delle pratiche stanno in `pratica_stati` (flag `is_working`, `is_approved`, `is_rejected`, `is_suspended`.). La vecchia `pratiches_statos` non si usa pi\u00f9.\n- Le app si parlano via API: chiavi solo nel `.env` (mai nel codice, nei log o nei commit) e nessuna lettura diretta delle tabelle di un'altra app se esiste un'API. Niente dati personali nei log","embedding":[-0.005403261,0.006946058,0.019232947,-0.0052611013,-0.010993226,0.002875048,0.013512798,-0.010113449,0.007594645,-0.04442006,-0.008864782,0.018876925,0.01852134,0.015986623,0.027432976,-0.014436625,0.010373956,-0.013059328,-0.012139059,-0.004520627,-0.018699076,0.0033863157,0.033302695,0.013561074,-0.02462815,0.024444284,0.0033390517,-0.023835082,-0.028795142,0.11957156,0.007713585,-0.0069111725,-3.3945882e-5,-0.01317432,0.008411428,0.005450404,-0.020049447,0.011709311,0.0044318116,-0.0061730393,0.0065256003,-0.0071560047,-0.012430333,-0.0068137967,0.031893767,-0.010142747,-0.018814804,0.016114911,0.0012483677,-0.00018693614,0.013842685,-0.0031252408,-0.00092902005,0.008924834,-0.0022014477,-0.0009790825,-0.014417855,0.0032584525,0.023323294,0.01078128,-0.012148472,-0.0020713946,0.009244505,0.030567797,-0.013899185,-0.006478622,0.026652519,-0.009994648,0.014379158,-0.005958266,-0.0032006563,0.024940697,-0.0032771847,0.007156