{"id":"4531f22e-3ccf-4aec-a42b-1b80c926ab6b","content":"\n- I database sono di sviluppo. Rispondi e scrivi i testi per gli utenti in italiano.\n- Se esiste `graphify-out\/GRAPH_REPORT.md`, consultalo prima di cercare nel codice; si aggiorna con `graphify update .`. Per l'estrazione semantica (documenti, PDF, immagini) graphify usa `GEMINI_API_KEY` dal `.env`: non stamparla n\u00e9 committarla.\n\n## Questa app: unicooam (compliance e organigramma)\n- L'organigramma \u00e8 la risorsa Dipendenti: i ruoli sono i nomi degli `EmployeeType` salvati in `employees.employee_roles` (fonte per tutta la suite) e i permessi stanno in `EmployeeTypePermission`.\n- Documenti, tipi documento, scadenziario, OAM\/IVASS, audit e reclami sono qui; i solleciti usano i template e le caselle di unico-core.\n\n### Manuali (consultali prima di rispondere)\n- Manuale utente: `resources\/manuals\/manuale-operativo-oam.html`. Manuale tecnico: `resources\/manuals\/manuale-tecnico.html`.\n- Ogni sezione ha un `id`: `grep -n 'id=\"' <file>` d\u00e0 l'indice, poi leggi la sezione che serve","embedding":[-0.010747759,-0.009435569,0.01149951,-0.026795944,-0.014029234,-0.009672607,0.022198722,0.006545746,-0.0040518586,-0.041157648,-0.012069584,0.027958497,0.009998265,-0.0053167036,0.024973085,0.0006071069,-0.0055276444,-0.014007442,-0.01581807,-0.00887629,-0.015476549,0.013543315,0.014782671,0.0020261568,-0.023471449,0.038169064,0.009565616,0.00012667643,-0.01844206,0.13688186,-0.022399602,-0.018960645,0.0029527764,-0.012154773,0.0020458575,-0.003567082,-0.013427031,-0.00024598165,0.010713219,-0.01582445,-0.01396361,-0.0034788318,-0.009166513,-0.0033128187,0.0052980967,0.019803166,-0.009311578,0.004138294,-0.0034961149,-0.01654172,0.0015608704,0.0037547755,0.007385883,0.010280217,-0.0087557435,-0.009646367,-0.021242345,-0.005826637,0.01517941,0.015514029,-0.004940139,-0.005867767,0.013940468,0.0002283002,0.0018261473,-0.0029232542,0.02017265,-0.022054078,0.014744918,-0.0014080115,-0.016201545,0.030076