{"id":"94085244-3ca5-4b28-87d8-66df475c188b","content":" L'appendice \u00abFatti dal codice\u00bb del manuale tecnico (rotte, comandi, modelli, variabili `.env`) \u00e8 generata: si rigenera con `python3 \/var\/www\/html\/unico-core\/tools\/manuals\/gen_facts.py \/var\/www\/html\/unicooam`; il resto \u00e8 scritto a mano e va aggiornato quando cambia il comportamento.\n- L'assistente (`App\\Neuron\\ManualAssistantAgent`) li indicizza con `php artisan manual:sync`: da rilanciare dopo ogni modifica.\n<!-- suite-unico:end -->\n\n<laravel-boost-guidelines>\n=== foundation rules ===\n\n# Laravel Boost Guidelines\n\n## Foundational Context\n\nThis application is a Laravel application running on PHP 8.4. Always use the APIs that match the installed major version of each package \u2014 do not assume a version.\n\nBefore relying on a package's API, confirm its installed version:\n- PHP packages: run `composer show --direct` to list direct dependencies with versions, or `composer show <vendor\/package>` for a single package.\n- JS packages: check `package.json` for the installed versions","embedding":[-0.01912818,0.002545768,0.01902669,-0.011855851,0.0013637944,0.012777633,0.00086046377,-0.007051322,0.0063150036,-0.0531521,-0.009940221,0.01963214,0.002390204,0.006673838,0.025419204,-0.018391887,0.024027811,-0.03785777,-0.014010987,-0.00080920244,-0.0056431103,-0.014712134,0.013245642,0.009033025,-0.020462919,0.022781715,-0.0031902303,-0.039060812,-0.030491859,0.1172708,0.0063671106,-0.025522279,-0.010313697,-0.031357847,0.0027806575,-0.0017796409,-0.007363264,0.010658211,-0.002420647,-0.012034392,0.002974879,-0.009995295,-0.0045665926,-0.012069174,0.010810731,-0.010745675,-0.009602915,0.017433727,0.0015650276,-0.008387329,0.019040516,-0.0069853733,-0.0017552566,-0.002032592,0.006733375,-0.011215121,-0.00402315,-0.0054271915,0.016249804,0.009924298,0.012414748,-0.027346259,0.02266762,0.0062713143,-0.011816167,-0.012815938,0.018767988,-0.008066419,0.003982184,-0.009148751,-0.00