{"id":"b1a7f00e-30b3-45ae-bd38-ea15c6e7f64a","content":"\n\n## Skills Activation\n\nThis project has domain-specific skills available in `**\/skills\/**`. You MUST activate the relevant skill whenever you work in that domain\u2014don't wait until you're stuck.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- You must follow all existing code conventions used in this application. When creating or editing a file, check sibling files for the correct structure, approach, and naming.\n- Use descriptive names for variables and methods. For example, `isRegisteredForDiscounts`, not `discount()`.\n- Check for existing components to reuse before writing a new one.\n\n## Verification Scripts\n\n- Do not create verification scripts or tinker when tests cover that functionality and prove they work. Unit and feature tests are more important.\n\n## Application Structure & Architecture\n\n- Stick to existing directory structure; don't create new base folders without approval.\n- Do not change the application's dependencies without approval","embedding":[0.003166305,0.033591427,0.021554543,-0.0090146735,-0.003698993,0.008096809,-0.0013397393,-0.008191664,0.0010539934,-0.042987235,-0.02118235,0.00978696,0.036978617,-0.0074408683,0.011263707,-0.023580816,0.005053844,-0.017550025,-0.0325632,0.0072878315,-0.029554723,-0.0205299,0.017459823,0.013570019,-0.009107388,0.0145064,-0.02476362,-0.05220133,-0.01942927,0.13607018,-0.010448996,-0.018709801,0.0022813436,-0.012469766,0.007442504,-0.01085074,-0.0015233074,0.014462478,-0.008799435,0.007021624,-0.003988033,0.006102174,-0.0009815778,-0.03180698,0.00483794,-0.005353076,-0.008099438,0.0009999503,0.009086828,-0.00700032,0.0061655086,0.011353727,0.004694558,-0.011016478,0.003491548,0.010066846,-0.003098438,0.019212987,0.020008825,-0.0019214259,0.004768572,-0.012777154,0.037406154,-0.0011550091,0.007950613,-0.0038189876,0.023271771,-0.001432941,0.0036516993,-0.0046263696,0.0016053285,-0.0052550607,-0.0059072534,0.02657111,-0.016516684,-0.037643027,-0.042716894,0.0106