{"id":"e884ed6e-2c7c-49ad-8033-5c8898f9218f","content":"php`:\n- `enabled`: Master on\/off switch (env: `ACTIVITYLOG_ENABLED`)\n- `clean_after_days`: Days to keep records for `activitylog:clean` command\n- `default_log_name`: Default log name (string)\n- `default_auth_driver`: Auth driver for causer resolution\n- `include_soft_deleted_subjects`: Include soft-deleted subjects\n- `activity_model`: Custom Activity model class\n- `default_except_attributes`: Globally excluded attributes\n- `actions.log_activity`: Action class for logging activities\n- `actions.clean_log`: Action class for cleaning old activities\n\n<\/laravel-boost-guidelines>\n\n- **Solleciti:** la logica \u00e8 del pacchetto (`Unico\\Core\\Documents\\Reminders\\DocumentReminderService`): `App\\Services\\DocumentReminderService` ne traduce solo lo stato in `CheckStatus` e inoltra il resto","embedding":[-0.008844038,-0.0017263978,0.024874946,-0.013553025,-0.0042338944,0.003294842,0.011630283,0.009049946,0.011333369,-0.0402572,-0.014415515,-0.0022847732,-0.0029677458,-0.012997348,0.021834519,0.0041856905,0.003991146,-0.01448324,-0.0045112586,0.003160003,-0.030093744,0.0027729198,0.013203206,0.0273794,-0.031660736,0.029525582,0.004710645,-0.02463375,-0.03693426,0.12940884,-0.012615673,-0.009031226,0.0073124617,-0.04626514,0.009518914,0.0005627909,-0.018189328,-0.0057889097,7.83755e-5,0.0041240957,-0.026895741,0.0087648565,-0.019430887,-0.0074954517,0.010669265,-0.008771171,-0.028479053,0.027526446,-8.213327e-5,0.0012073109,0.038118232,-0.013612523,-0.0003379432,-0.00034462594,0.013923608,-0.0023600082,0.014674028,-0.002964376,0.023513392,0.008962142,0.009525304,0.010578967,0.006459235,0.011894302,-0.02109955,-0.013688761,0.0176834,-0.0083544385,0.016951658,-0.0048685893,-0.0088506285,0.035590727,-0.021886272,-0.006234594,-0.0018117556,-0.010080508,-0.031614315,0.033033926,0.005811878,0.015638737,-0.022239884,-0.021843078,-0.017579203,-0.010003238,-0.0041744052,0.012612146,-0.008112047,-0.020746121,0.00736