{"id":"4204565a-2a58-47b9-8f5d-bae2d0565e36","content":"Manuale operativo OAM \u2014 UnicoOAM\n \n\nManuale operativo OAM \u2014 UnicoOAM\n\nUnicoOAM \u00e8 l'applicativo con cui la societ\u00e0 di mediazione creditizia gestisce gli\nadempimenti previsti dall'iscrizione all'OAM (Organismo degli Agenti\ne dei Mediatori): tenuta del registro reclami, delle segnalazioni di operazioni\nsospette (SOS\/antiriciclaggio), degli audit periodici e la compilazione della\nrelazione semestrale da inviare all'OAM. I dati sulle pratiche di\nfinanziamento e sulle provvigioni non si inseriscono qui a mano: arrivano importati\ndal gestionale UnicoCoge (gi\u00e0 Proforma), che gira sullo stesso server MySQL ma su un database\nseparato, in sola lettura.\n\nIndice\n1. Accesso e ruoli\n2. Anagrafiche\n3. Import delle pratiche da UnicoCoge\n4. Relazione semestrale OAM (M510)\n5. Audit interni e rilievi\n6. Registro reclami\n7. Segnalazioni operazioni sospette (SOS)\n8. Documenti e scadenzario\n9. Modelli email e plichi documentali\n10. Organismi di vigilanza e piani di rimedio\n11. Utenti, ruoli e permessi\n12","embedding":[0.0036534183,0.023046851,0.00064811367,0.0046678474,0.0071525555,0.0067252205,0.008289102,0.0067111487,0.005732859,-0.052312765,-0.0055316277,0.021663554,0.0045692045,0.006500357,0.028427795,-0.024542943,-0.0045260685,-0.011011373,0.004640203,-0.019907089,-0.018374944,-0.0021977166,0.009970881,0.0029810541,-0.0042016343,0.0036587236,0.0068608066,-0.020220092,-0.030524135,0.13313276,0.01949174,-0.0047085593,0.0033425135,-0.018618643,0.014896929,-0.0073692007,-0.027556315,0.017670061,0.006432109,-0.021128759,-0.010673109,-0.0089538535,0.0062008486,0.008241178,-0.0012873097,0.014533883,0.0030014906,-0.0055340957,0.00077425904,0.0031289568,0.016128521,0.0044744657,-0.016674222,0.020295221,0.0050519602,-0.005197197,-0.0017624091,-0.0050063482,0.015303802,0.010729501,0.0072774235,-0.013555098,-0.009106499,0.017930731,-0.011247724,-0.02502632,0.02043938,-0.0022475256,0.008936