{"id":"783c9910-f0b7-4880-9daf-c9b0060fbb90","content":" Assistente AI\n13. Integrazioni API\n14. Glossario\n\n1. Accesso e ruoli\n\nSi accede dal pannello all'indirizzo \/admin, con login Microsoft o\nGoogle (pulsanti \"Accedi con Microsoft\" \/ \"Accedi con Google\" nella pagina di\nlogin) oppure con email e password se l'account \u00e8 gi\u00e0 stato creato manualmente.\n\nOgni utente ha un ruolo (campo role sulla scheda\nutente) che determina cosa pu\u00f2 vedere, indipendentemente dal menu:\n\nRuoloCosa pu\u00f2 usare\n\nadmin \/ userTutte le funzionalit\u00e0 abilitate dal piano attivo.\n\ninspector (Ispettore)Solo Audit, Reclami, Segnalazioni SOS, Semestrale OAM e la scheda documenti dei fascicoli.\n\nquality (Qualit\u00e0)Solo Audit e la scheda documenti.\n\nsosRuolo riservato all'ambito antiriciclaggio.\n\nSe una voce di menu non compare, o si prova ad aprirne l'indirizzo direttamente e\nsi riceve un errore di autorizzazione, \u00e8 perch\u00e9 il ruolo o il piano attivo non\ncomprendono quella funzionalit\u00e0: non \u00e8 un guasto, va richiesto all'amministratore\ndi cambiare ruolo","embedding":[-0.0047141435,0.016289817,0.024262134,-0.009910104,-0.000860981,0.0024319144,0.02507168,0.008861711,0.010083048,-0.063144535,-0.012219275,0.03093398,0.017943075,-0.012591264,0.014431675,-0.0134595195,0.02257239,0.0060142362,0.0020448854,-0.0016606362,-0.02860414,0.019893039,0.0017608412,0.025842778,-0.016716113,0.021793183,0.014141794,9.165912e-5,-0.04015193,0.12150971,-0.010132735,-0.012637195,0.008766624,-0.010069298,-0.008217432,-0.0066592502,-0.010920191,0.012579129,0.010552987,0.0008235644,-0.0028891352,0.0047962726,0.011031692,-0.00059696246,0.0026902617,0.008755731,0.003009406,0.0073530064,0.022052659,0.013825891,0.031639326,0.010613316,-0.01039023,0.011202375,0.0010770912,0.0003494019,-0.0076596886,-0.0077098394,0.028670518,0.012769108,0.0030618687,-0.011493284,0.0055305264,0.011237068,-0.004922354,-0.0042020455,-0.005383643,-0.013264155,0.01900493,0.0028