{"id":"b7986b4b-7dff-484e-91cb-0380a9e8506c","content":"\n\nOltre al ruolo generale esiste un secondo livello di permessi, pi\u00f9 fine, legato al\nprofilo Collaboratore (scheda \"Organigramma\") e ai suoi\nRuoli\/Moduli (vedi \u00a711): serve per\ndistinguere, ad esempio, chi pu\u00f2 solo consultare un elenco da chi pu\u00f2 anche\ncrearne o cancellarne le righe.\n\n2. Anagrafiche\n\nNel gruppo di menu Anagrafiche:\n\nAzienda\n\nScheda unica con i dati della societ\u00e0 di mediazione: ragione sociale, partita\nIVA, numero di iscrizione OAM e data iscrizione\/rinnovo, eventuale iscrizione\nIVASS (sezione RUI, numero, data), gruppo\/sponsor di appartenenza. Questi dati\nalimentano il foglio \"Anagrafica\" della relazione semestrale, quindi vanno\ntenuti aggiornati prima di generare l'export.\n\nSedi\n\nElenco delle sedi operative e della sede legale (una sola marcata come \"Sede\nprincipale\"). Per ciascuna: indirizzo completo, responsabile di sede, data di\napertura ed eventuale chiusura. Alimentano il foglio \"Sedi\" della relazione\nsemestrale","embedding":[0.0046012974,0.028143678,0.0058094794,-0.004505007,0.010864203,-0.013371949,0.025145892,0.0033342286,-0.012722413,-0.054742217,-0.015197755,0.02696355,0.008223733,-0.006830975,0.015228062,-0.005295637,-0.0031392195,-0.0024408197,0.00011975006,-0.020467523,-0.018681848,0.014240437,0.0046444586,0.01588854,-0.009404232,0.012771924,0.0084766885,-0.003914375,-0.039870802,0.07709238,0.016235908,-0.0226157,0.013036103,-0.0012387586,0.012271205,-0.0012974436,-0.04160292,-0.0041207015,-0.0026705544,-0.013237307,-0.017597836,-0.01530443,0.0022567713,-0.009733144,0.017626712,0.0064944876,-0.012317334,-0.020543883,0.001068681,0.02356368,0.034450576,0.01803739,0.0013495464,6.111116e-5,-0.001047074,0.006108492,-0.006154704,0.0021564628,0.030415883,0.023124017,0.017205711,-0.013126845,-0.010225424,0.00502245,-0.000641978,-0.001731932,0.014665841,-0.007392835,0.0077920854,-0.0058690966,0.0033827662,0.025853693,0.010901747,0