{"id":"a1255c94-5b37-4c8e-8ee2-48a24793a2a0","content":"\n\nSiti web\n\nDomini istituzionali o commerciali collegati alla societ\u00e0, con la data di\npubblicazione del foglio informativo\/trasparenza: alimenta il foglio\n\"Informativo\" della relazione semestrale.\n\nIstituti Eroganti e Produttori\n\n\"Istituti Eroganti\" \u00e8 l'anagrafica delle banche\/istituti finanziari mandanti\n(dati condivisi con le altre app della suite, in sola lettura); \"Produttori\" \u00e8 l'anagrafica degli\nagenti\/collaboratori commerciali (anch'essa condivisa con la suite). Da qui si verifica se\nun istituto \u00e8 convenzionato e si consultano eventuali blacklist.\n\nCodici OAM\n\nTabella di corrispondenza tra il tipo di prodotto gestito internamente (es.\n\"Mutuo\", \"Cessione del Quinto\") e la classificazione di prodotto creditizio\nrichiesta dall'OAM. Va mantenuta aggiornata: se manca la corrispondenza per un\nnuovo tipo di prodotto, l'importazione delle pratiche (\u00a73) non riesce a\nclassificarlo correttamente nella relazione","embedding":[-0.008746372,0.026035529,0.0035726517,-0.005237807,0.012583651,0.008624281,0.017996833,-0.009687539,-0.012957056,-0.053883843,-0.01764328,0.0031464433,0.012830422,-0.005636168,0.023285182,-0.01021499,0.016193023,-0.004220066,0.017680725,-0.02712372,-0.008372588,0.018093562,0.008547399,0.0055178655,-0.012382418,0.03266077,0.0047016423,-0.015270069,-0.023391442,0.10808869,0.009051099,-0.0056695123,0.0076079695,-0.004922964,0.0013732376,0.011141159,-0.013483783,-0.0015900136,-0.0078227725,-0.023001974,-0.018329643,-0.014960599,-0.0041030934,-0.0006716534,0.016807469,-0.006033199,-0.007737716,-0.005007414,0.006451902,0.015265254,0.05343715,0.027925273,-0.008401558,0.010457047,0.014723702,0.012611117,0.0015107113,0.008806909,0.020454941,0.0029046978,0.0021594353,-0.011827736,-0.011284643,0.007497622,-0.0068947603,0.008386328,0.013606415,-0.007909218,0.008813529,0.001926654,-0.004311521,0.029061798,0.004677368,0.012609164,-0.031158745,0.00784