{"id":"c1f28e9e-f92d-463d-b672-7b0d7fb00af1","content":"\n\nOrganigramma (Collaboratori)\n\nAnagrafica dei dipendenti e collaboratori interni, con iscrizioni professionali\n(OAM, RUI\/IVASS), sede di appartenenza, responsabile diretto e ruoli\nprivacy\/GDPR. Da qui si assegna anche il tipo di collaboratore\nusato per calcolare i permessi granulari (\u00a711).\n\n3. Import delle pratiche da UnicoCoge\n\nLe pratiche di finanziamento e le relative provvigioni sono gestite nel\ngestionale UnicoCoge (gi\u00e0 Proforma), su un database separato dello stesso\nserver MySQL, collegato in sola lettura: da UnicoOAM non si\ncrea n\u00e9 si modifica mai una pratica direttamente.\n\nPer portare i dati di un semestre dentro UnicoOAM si usa l'importazione,\ndisponibile in due modi:\n\nDal pannello: sezione \"Semestrale OAM\", pulsante\n\"Importa Pratiche\" nella pagina elenco. Importa sempre il\nsemestre corrente (quello in corso o appena chiuso, calcolato automaticamente\nin base alla data odierna)","embedding":[-0.003162612,0.036303166,-0.0027281223,-0.0091954125,-0.00937243,-0.010105685,0.022063691,0.001964702,-0.015526265,-0.053653836,-0.01365179,0.030877061,-3.1968433e-5,0.0074019306,0.013467939,-0.012009196,-0.005740852,-0.008711387,0.0003275702,-0.036535136,-0.010026862,0.0039423886,0.009505119,0.024529647,-0.0072329114,0.02766385,0.004852547,-0.017972158,-0.03253554,0.10052946,0.01127909,-0.005113398,0.0009518546,-0.025702024,-0.0037141216,-0.00655009,-0.040524304,0.007397482,0.00024127262,-0.014273513,-0.008300446,-0.011798089,-0.007368508,0.0019959558,0.008839836,0.005950605,-0.0044540106,-0.0142657785,0.010893831,0.006643233,0.036449276,0.019571522,-0.028132794,0.00920892,0.010748236,0.022202492,-0.0148261115,-0.010414001,0.042639833,0.021877933,0.017095463,-0.015358765,-0.0060726185,0.012534173,-0.014046052,0.00093662215,0.01564955,-0.013104709,0.0152625805,-0.004799957,-0.010702089,0.014330587,0.0073459474,0.0073755938,-0.01804581,-0.0011967298,-0.048404574,0.015314773