{"id":"44361121-3a0b-4410-9f07-7040f24e1fa8","content":"\n\nDurante l'importazione il sistema, per ogni pratica del semestre:\n\nrecupera l'istituto erogante, il produttore\/agente e le provvigioni\n(cliente, istituto, premio, agente, eventuali storni) sommandole da UnicoCoge;\n\ncalcola l'erogato lordo (0 se l'istituto non \u00e8 una banca convenzionata,\naltrimenti l'importo netto o l'importo lordo a seconda del tipo di prodotto);\n\nclassifica il prodotto creditizio tramite i Codici OAM (\u00a72) e distingue le\npratiche gi\u00e0 erogate da quelle ancora in lavorazione;\n\nriporta separatamente gli eventuali storni\/rivalse su provvigioni di\npratiche erogate in periodi precedenti.\n\nL'esito (numero di pratiche importate, o l'errore riscontrato) compare in una\nnotifica a fine operazione. I dati importati sono consultabili in sola lettura\nin \"OAM Dettaglio\" (riga per riga) e vengono riepilogati in \"Semestrale OAM\"\n(aggregati per istituto e prodotto).\n\n4","embedding":[-0.012612794,0.029805304,-0.007864446,-0.018252704,-0.0017009438,-0.011039101,0.00581157,0.0006786071,-0.020314246,-0.05006083,0.0009996811,0.033886794,0.013111952,0.012429819,0.004902507,-0.0020900243,0.012822242,-0.007241676,0.00427418,-0.033414558,-0.010924387,-0.0014809221,0.013733614,0.010307783,0.013980265,0.014776048,0.0076699923,-0.022438522,-0.020213157,0.090970114,0.014360566,0.00391424,0.009006061,-0.024369802,0.010109123,0.0012452443,-0.015296323,-0.017129604,-0.0033728858,-0.030982519,0.0024504978,-0.00749096,-0.008024186,0.008115414,0.0045805797,0.012719985,-0.0028537586,0.007827491,0.018730564,0.013260488,0.03312065,0.011008354,-0.0243662,0.016476033,0.011604967,0.024866322,-0.0064861104,-0.013274167,0.034403022,0.03295798,0.0029479861,-0.017644985,-0.0021740482,0.023790548,-0.00070768653,0.0049335384,0.007828483,-0.030864583,0.012371267,0.0055517294,-0.009396747,-0.008110445,0.006383466,0.027150225,-0.0068087806,-0.0016678849,-0.04445634,0.008903221,0.005439819,0.028658638,-0