{"id":"a2a6e291-96d0-47ce-abe9-dba2ca953e93","content":"\n\nIl pulsante \"Completo\" genera il file con tutti i fogli in una\nsola cartella di lavoro; i pulsanti \"Analitico\", \"Base\", \"Anagrafica\",\n\"Informativo\", \"Sedi\", \"Prudenziale\" generano il singolo foglio isolato, utile\nper verificare un dato prima dell'invio ufficiale. \"Analitico\" riporta una riga\nper ogni combinazione istituto\/prodotto; \"Base\" ne d\u00e0 la versione riassuntiva,\ncon una sola riga per prodotto creditizio (somma di tutti gli istituti, come le\nsole righe di totale della tabella \"OAM Semestrale\" raggruppata per prodotto).\n\nPrima di esportare la relazione, verificare di aver eseguito l'importazione del\nperiodo corretto (\u00a73) e che anagrafica azienda, sedi e siti web siano\naggiornati: l'esportazione fotografa i dati presenti in quel momento, non li\nricalcola.\n\n5. Audit interni e rilievi\n\nLa sezione Audit \u00e8 il registro dei controlli periodici,\ndocumentali o in loco, svolti sulla rete (dipendenti, agenti, sedi)","embedding":[-0.0025373905,0.035039324,0.0040537636,-0.014683303,0.013791383,-0.006450969,0.015015605,-0.013032921,-0.018678287,-0.0496118,-0.007864791,0.032326993,0.018472062,-0.015399619,0.0035872518,-0.0019297011,0.008070723,0.0029628717,0.0039810766,-0.021229582,-0.011163108,-0.0030910878,-0.0052429214,0.011918836,0.0060106306,0.018556181,0.005077871,-0.023866663,-0.012888532,0.08802107,0.007179701,-0.013132473,0.009873777,-0.014678556,0.014007636,-0.006920241,-0.01888348,-0.0077557117,0.010681271,-0.02513285,-0.00177193,-0.017429693,0.015026936,-0.0048682056,0.0037948657,0.009325728,-0.0012952744,-0.00549997,0.008661502,0.016457641,0.03993743,0.00496332,-0.0010198054,0.0072617456,-0.012388965,0.012206799,-0.0041236873,-0.00067186006,0.024626013,0.03969766,0.00042673515,-0.016358936,-0.013214513,0.00010331967,0.008523216,0.0011812178,0.0124707725,-0.016196767,0.015828613,-0.005296012,0.0062881964,-0.00075455615,0.005870499,0.01703206,-0.012721189