{"id":"dd7a839d-bb4b-461a-8698-f693f0228246","content":" Ogni audit\nha:\n\nun soggetto controllato e, se richiesto da un ente esterno\n(es. la stessa OAM), l'organismo di riferimento (\u00a710);\n\nuna modalit\u00e0 di esecuzione (documentale, audit, ispezione) e le date di\nprogrammazione ed esecuzione;\n\nun numero di protocollo, assegnato automaticamente in\nsequenza per anno (formato AAAA\/NNNN) se lasciato vuoto;\n\nun esito (conforme \/ non conforme) e, se non conforme, un piano di rimedio e\nuna data di follow-up.\n\nSe dall'audit emergono criticit\u00e0 puntuali, si aprono uno o pi\u00f9\nrilievi (scheda \"Rilievi audit\", accessibile dal dettaglio\ndell'audit): ciascun rilievo ha una gravit\u00e0 (osservazione, minore, maggiore,\ncritica), uno stato (aperto, in lavorazione, risolto, rischio accettato,\nchiuso), pu\u00f2 richiedere un approfondimento e\/o un'azione correttiva con\nscadenza propria. La dashboard segnala nel riquadro \"Audit in corso\" quanti\nrilievi sono ancora aperti o in lavorazione","embedding":[-0.019120194,0.018030016,0.034920674,-0.008791761,0.021019572,-0.01715723,0.019438544,-0.001969824,0.0123378085,-0.04339936,-0.00430607,0.007973899,0.019029796,0.004078018,0.023398506,-0.0016422267,0.0051113577,-0.0049341205,0.013337863,-0.005518605,-0.012868122,0.030679325,0.0050085876,-0.0060320147,-0.007034182,0.011465711,0.021884006,-0.005460991,-0.0207578,0.11608192,-0.019417753,-0.011385797,0.017239347,-0.019788153,-0.0049815327,-0.003849267,-0.013497022,-0.008279611,0.008972584,-0.019894602,0.00029011865,-0.01459655,0.011349918,0.0027514591,-0.014326342,-0.00080395536,0.018886639,0.011872455,0.00047769776,0.00944009,0.045214448,0.0034129422,0.011652597,0.012115082,0.007683033,0.00208834,0.004752897,0.0040285513,0.010173207,0.010791083,-0.0034344618,-0.009006728,-0.008471672,-0.0017127871,0.0036645427,-0.013538214,0.022178752,-0.009978123,0.018916454,0.014662644,0.0017281679,0.011693478,0.0038955319,-0.021484016,-0.01824406,-0.007382291,-0.