{"id":"e3dc3b2a-b081-40af-b760-f6f988b20af6","content":"\n\nOgni modifica ad audit e rilievi (creazione, cambio di stato, chiusura) resta\ntracciata nel registro attivit\u00e0, conservato per 10 anni: \u00e8 la prova, in caso di\nispezione OAM, di chi ha fatto cosa e quando.\n\n6. Registro reclami\n\nIl Registro reclami \u00e8 l'adempimento verso i clienti: ogni\nreclamo ricevuto va protocollato qui, indipendentemente dal canale con cui \u00e8\narrivato","embedding":[-0.009228323,0.0059844055,0.024108121,-0.002531145,0.016628344,-0.01479339,0.026043735,-0.009918617,-0.0030353607,-0.04639939,-0.016694274,0.015070557,0.026991213,-0.010244002,0.025237551,-0.008050919,-0.0027588604,-0.008178505,0.008055172,0.004058636,-0.026433742,0.02454522,0.0014440678,-0.002922006,-0.015854359,0.024709139,0.022497624,-0.009429169,-0.018224971,0.12673144,-0.009892958,-0.0076350053,0.021115923,0.0017996059,-0.0018438633,-0.010373635,-0.01386535,-0.0024302858,-0.0071783266,-0.012503596,-0.023895495,-0.00666913,0.016030103,-0.005185754,-0.0039732256,-0.0065961587,0.016786756,0.011494726,0.0104189515,-0.006978191,0.040666725,0.0067451647,-0.0016580493,0.027594846,0.01077311,0.01039192,0.013380448,0.007315962,0.03176976,0.0074182036,0.0073259114,-0.019487582,-0.0011224302,0.005233478,-0.014844143,-0.0043853135,0.022041647,0.00984284,0.014202123,0.008058194,-0.004005832,0.029110216,0.009237542,0.011866305,-0.006763491,-0.011353504,-0.032144316,0.005502584,-0.0073858374,0.032266874,-0.008138982,-0.018848097,-0.024312759,-0.012394179,-0.016900681,0.003955708,-0.000981272,0.00047532213,0.0061112954,0.017730623,-0.02001026,-0.0030269062,0.0078067095,-0.014653843,-0.04361247,0.0051876786,-0.008354962,-0.0052642743,-0.03083315,0.01884251,0.008272628,-0.0033048522,-0.005811545,-0.0066088545,0.023795543,0.0016661867,-0.014891706,0.028112696,0.0038532682,-0.019466132,-0.0038801662,-0.14776693,0.010774605,-0.0032814348,0.013143514,-0.020770682,0.013151256,-0.00023421837,-0.00061159447,0.029613337,-0.