{"id":"64ef2ef6-6a17-46df-b01f-92bc8b36b8b1","content":"\n\nCampi principali alla creazione:\n\ndata e canale di ricezione (PEC, raccomandata, email,\nconsegna a mano) ed eventuale casella email che lo ha ricevuto;\n\ndati del reclamante (nome, email; pu\u00f2 essere collegato a un cliente,\ndipendente o produttore gi\u00e0 censito);\n\nmacro-categoria (finanziario, privacy, assicurativo, operativo) e categoria\ndi dettaglio (ritardo, comportamento, frode, tassi, accesso GDPR, cancellazione\nGDPR, trasparenza);\n\nl'agente e\/o l'istituto\/banca coinvolti nel prodotto contestato;\n\ndescrizione, eventuale impatto economico stimato;\n\nesito (aperto, in istruttoria, accolto, respinto, escalation) e, se\nconcluso, note di risoluzione.\n\nIl numero di protocollo (AAAA\/NNNN) viene assegnato\nautomaticamente in sequenza per anno se non indicato a mano","embedding":[-0.007246056,0.0025999031,0.0071305223,-0.017016428,0.0057006455,-0.006880604,0.021532273,-0.002456926,-0.0019531522,-0.045945514,-0.012502803,0.018913558,0.012733991,0.0001077458,0.023614723,-0.0327174,-0.005303072,-0.025346095,-0.010900923,-0.022671128,-0.03220992,0.013813564,0.016908912,-0.00024216986,-0.02376526,0.024079295,-0.001443759,-0.01881909,-0.006245533,0.11771248,-0.010853947,-0.0070921388,-0.0075498517,-0.0116475085,-0.005760052,0.0059130443,-0.023558488,-0.00041021514,-0.013145317,0.004876729,0.008640493,-0.01902912,0.0031523388,-0.0041258726,0.0037487485,-0.008385813,-0.024498237,0.0015748355,-0.0046546375,0.001960882,0.014922807,0.012080404,-0.0062203216,0.023494842,0.0124568,-0.0032696961,0.0062902244,0.0017406598,0.017283155,0.023866083,-0.0073730205,-0.006314222,0.0067377724,0.019366322,-0.0023041486,-0.005164802,0.020969694,-0.00087354257,0.0029822113,0.006560093,-0.022698965,0.021610664,0.01046636,-0.013912097,-0.021876574,-0.010288771,-0.042901456,0.0065583154,-0.0072585456,0.010533435,-0.012802017,-0.025145162,-0.011810948,-0.011338409,-0.031081636,0.008350071,0.008906948,-0.005100708,