{"id":"62ef9551-980c-4704-9105-b233ac16928c","content":" Un job programmato (documents:send-reminders,\nogni giorno alle 8:00) invia automaticamente un promemoria via email al\nreferente competente man mano che ci si avvicina alla scadenza (secondo le\nsoglie configurate sul tipo documento), e registra ogni invio per non\nsollecitare due volte la stessa scadenza a distanza di pochi giorni. La\ndashboard mostra in \"Documenti scaduti\" quelli monitorati gi\u00e0 oltre la data di\nscadenza, con collegamento diretto allo scadenzario.\n\nIl download di un allegato richiede sempre di essere autenticati\nnell'applicativo: un link al singolo file non \u00e8 mai accessibile pubblicamente.\n\nAggiornare un documento senza caricare un nuovo allegato\n\nQuando un documento va semplicemente rinnovato (es. rinnovo annuale di\nun'iscrizione) senza sostituire il file allegato, dall'elenco dello\nScadenziario \u00e8 sufficiente cliccare sulla riga del documento:\nsi apre una finestra con il campo \"Nuova data di emissione\", da compilare e\nconfermare","embedding":[0.009726709,0.00083783077,0.024695987,0.00035863902,0.0052613034,-0.008202657,-0.0008266467,-0.005715953,0.008763033,-0.03732062,-0.017002935,0.018168524,-0.0068801115,-0.002031329,0.012111761,-0.020552507,-0.0070186127,-0.011636282,-0.012428559,-0.02212684,-0.046890855,0.012570298,-0.007770435,0.019756224,-0.024519598,0.048169285,-0.0006678943,-0.015080288,-0.011731956,0.086920016,-1.7276321e-5,-0.03913418,-0.004923812,-0.044086084,-0.0041169063,0.01100634,-0.03336432,0.0061393,0.0028438293,0.0011523123,2.290117e-5,0.0068732062,-0.018746952,-0.012772331,0.0011280251,-0.0010210711,-0.009988467,0.006630037,0.014843781,0.0053845816,0.031057168,0.0048438483,0.006422019,0.01182906,-0.042424787,-0.00015274825,0.0049985093,-0.0119497385,0.0356072,0.0024973322,0.021507122,-0.007122492,0.014449645,0.0028749846,-0.011602585,0.0063943546,0.025852416,0.013709335,0.011160733,0.003319847,0.012789163,0.03882255,0.022888774,0.008547955