{"id":"28415bd8-7502-4c2d-8a40-8cc4309f3ce8","content":" Il sistema ricalcola in automatico la nuova data di scadenza in\nbase alla durata di validit\u00e0 prevista per quel tipo documento.\n\nAggiornare un documento caricando un nuovo allegato\n\nSe invece il documento va rinnovato sostituendo anche il file allegato,\nnella stessa finestra (click sulla riga in Scadenziario, campo \"Nuova data di\nemissione\") \u00e8 presente anche il campo facoltativo \"Nuovo allegato\n(opzionale)\": caricando qui un file, il sistema crea automaticamente\nuna nuova versione del documento con il nuovo allegato e la nuova data di\nemissione\/scadenza, mentre il documento precedente viene conservato in\narchivio con stato \"scaduto\", mantenendo cos\u00ec lo storico delle versioni\nprecedenti.\n\nEliminare un vecchio documento\n\nPer eliminare uno o pi\u00f9 documenti dallo Scadenziario: selezionare il\/i\ndocumento\/i spuntando il quadratino di selezione sulla riga corrispondente,\npremere il pulsante Azioni nella barra in alto e scegliere la\nvoce \"Elimina documenti\"","embedding":[0.016726512,0.0028808045,0.029070506,-0.0099799745,0.0005509476,-0.0010395774,-0.0003221709,-0.012709173,-6.705272e-5,-0.03394108,-0.020111203,0.017138895,0.022615202,-0.0054982225,0.013398645,-0.019589307,0.012441639,-0.0091608865,-0.016332151,-0.018241746,-0.03737363,0.01790368,-0.008443635,-0.0045704716,-0.01624599,0.028630877,0.0008878826,-0.009727507,-0.0024312134,0.09328742,0.007617468,-0.040797222,-0.0031516282,-0.04151243,-0.018700268,0.006005009,-0.031063374,0.0012897233,-0.010400212,-0.013462142,-0.00017589238,-0.012102693,-0.015301841,-0.014264941,-0.000584799,0.00788848,-0.0029396575,0.016612934,0.018689314,-0.0081685325,0.024745923,0.013702211,0.012357312,0.02202771,-0.03745957,-0.005131371,0.002512466,0.004373161,0.031747762,-0.005645221,0.0073695765,0.008568558,0.007912241,0.0041780793,0.0032864243,0.010140532,0.03467582,0.013209136,0.008545388,0.009918533,0.0042460645,0.029533472,0.045049