{"id":"5c6ae01a-c426-4153-9d22-4a5c55071526","content":" Viene richiesta una conferma prima\ndi procedere: l'operazione elimina sia il record di documento sia il relativo\nallegato caricato.\n\nPer eliminare un singolo documento dall'Elenco Documenti\n(ad esempio dalla scheda documenti di un dipendente, una sede o un'azienda), la\nriga in tabella non espone un pulsante di eliminazione diretta: occorre aprire\nil documento in modifica (pulsante Modifica) e usare l'azione\n\"Elimina\" presente nell'intestazione della relativa scheda.\nQuesta scelta riduce il rischio di eliminazioni accidentali dall'elenco.\n\n9. Modelli email e plichi documentali\n\nModelli email (menu System) sono i testi standard usati dai\npromemoria automatici e da altre comunicazioni: contengono segnaposto (es.\n{agente_nome}, {documento_nome}, {elenco_documenti})\nsostituiti automaticamente con i dati reali al momento dell'invio.\n\nPlico documentale \u00e8 l'elenco di documenti richiesti in blocco\nper completare una pratica o un onboarding (es","embedding":[0.0010768189,0.003662468,0.03306384,-0.018882316,0.0049151103,0.006705633,0.01955603,-0.005134932,0.0139708035,-0.03675212,-0.029463017,0.025232924,0.018359149,-0.012153288,0.016109813,-0.03430654,0.0182358,-0.015601058,-0.02141383,-0.025703978,-0.041796803,0.02020166,-0.0013070201,0.020672437,-0.02739289,0.04650629,0.0061068907,0.0058216034,-0.027144905,0.093271196,-0.007172635,-0.023889806,0.016731732,-0.02191728,-0.009870331,-0.012357314,-0.036142476,0.014205468,0.01340036,-0.004873981,-0.0028469937,-0.0047983024,-0.006187762,-0.027536707,-0.010089025,0.002331287,-0.00062881655,-0.002839883,0.020504232,0.0011025948,0.019097392,0.009880979,0.0051604435,0.0016068227,-0.025504254,-0.015119552,0.002697841,-0.0023925283,0.034976386,0.018073302,0.021215001,-0.018630177,0.015258402,0.0028768,-0.03270315,-0.0047689104,0.01104408,-0.0070563043,0.019751757,-0.0036228753,-0.0023074183,0.032834586,0.023715248,0.006947088,-0.03232622,-0.0036267107,-0