{"id":"7784cc63-a59d-4b4d-8c02-27c117f53fcc","content":" tutti i documenti necessari per\nattivare un nuovo collaboratore): raggruppa pi\u00f9 Tipi Documento in un'unica\nchecklist da seguire fino al completamento.\n\n10. Organismi di vigilanza e piani di rimedio\n\nOrganismi (menu System) \u00e8 l'anagrafica degli enti esterni che\npossono richiedere o disporre un controllo (OAM, IVASS, altri organismi di\nvigilanza): si collega agli Audit quando il controllo non \u00e8 di iniziativa\ninterna.\n\nPiani di rimedio raccoglie le azioni correttive strutturate\naperte a seguito di un audit non conforme o di un rilievo importante, con\nresponsabile e scadenza, per tenere traccia della loro chiusura nel tempo.\n\n11. Utenti, ruoli e permessi\n\nOltre al ruolo generale dell'utente (\u00a71), l'accesso alle singole sezioni pu\u00f2\nessere affinato con il motore di permessi basato su:\n\nModuli (menu System, sezione \"Moduli\"): il catalogo delle\nrisorse gestibili (es. \"Audit\", \"Registro Reclami\", \"Dipendenti\".), ciascuna\ncon un piano minimo richiesto;\n\nRuoli (tipi di collaboratore, es","embedding":[-0.01111109,0.01938134,0.02078678,-0.0007099934,0.004652232,-0.020183636,0.024416296,0.005511388,0.02697485,-0.043937284,-0.01796219,0.028664745,0.014830766,-0.0067252987,0.020922406,-0.02244136,0.0011304589,-0.007292303,-0.007507239,-0.007654701,-0.02767765,0.016156536,0.004239899,0.016830744,-0.018011184,0.029891912,0.03067928,-0.00905532,-0.03159197,0.08486691,-0.0071134674,-0.021711791,0.022160297,0.0050975885,-0.016154217,-0.0074228276,-0.03647527,0.0046782754,0.019354297,-0.012285778,0.0012894863,-0.011922521,0.017327072,-0.0018414401,-0.0055133277,0.005264037,0.004465749,0.00744777,-0.0027908008,0.0068473285,0.03575336,0.006366804,0.011596205,0.01479409,-0.018234476,-0.016803166,-0.0074610747,0.015901078,0.04061588,0.011458972,0.022003068,-0.010819684,0.0015087544,0.009603505,0.004821938,-0.012289483,0.014283145,0.002220264,0.02034451,-0.0023171867,-0.009207445,