{"id":"88b8e21e-b591-4f94-96b6-19684d8dc192","content":" \"Responsabile\nCompliance\", \"Backoffice\"): per ciascun ruolo si definisce, modulo per modulo,\nquali azioni sono permesse (elenco, dettaglio, creazione, modifica,\neliminazione) tramite una matrice di interruttori nella scheda del ruolo;\n\nogni collaboratore (\u00a72 \"Organigramma\") viene poi associato a uno o pi\u00f9\nruoli, ereditandone i permessi.\n\nChi non ha il permesso su un modulo non lo vede nel menu e non pu\u00f2 aprirne le\npagine nemmeno digitando l'indirizzo a mano.\n\n12. Assistente AI\n\nLa voce di menu \"Assistente AI\" permette di fare due tipi di\ndomande:\n\ndomande procedurali (\"come si registra un reclamo?\", \"dove\nsi trova lo scadenzario documenti?\"): la risposta viene cercata in questo\nmanuale e nel manuale tecnico;\n\ndomande sui dati operativi (\"quante pratiche OAM in\nlavorazione ci sono questo semestre?\", \"quali documenti scadono questo mese?\"):\nl'assistente interroga il database in sola lettura, limitatamente alle tabelle\ndi dominio (mai credenziali, password o token)","embedding":[-0.018085705,-0.0062101656,0.000528671,0.00837821,0.0065554413,-0.008100655,0.03823432,0.0036889762,0.0064655337,-0.040022824,-0.023284078,0.02970727,-0.0035595843,-0.0072790887,0.015766863,-0.010904751,0.010852842,-0.012081333,-0.00020293955,-0.01833976,-0.033331126,0.02692567,0.009549073,0.037633944,-0.023427242,0.013826863,0.024362462,-0.008140143,-0.0381185,0.11289598,-0.008372557,-0.022260843,0.014079059,0.00089347915,-0.004496074,-0.011849313,-0.02484738,0.0017735456,0.005024923,-0.014974996,-0.0012569452,-0.004086339,0.013397979,0.0049676504,0.0011102003,0.002662177,-0.0076085306,-0.0032975532,0.0033035118,0.0046709413,0.019909754,0.014370769,0.006321891,0.01877542,0.00010164988,0.00056072284,0.0064934846,-0.006490701,0.029506631,0.026709735,0.004751736,-0.008584905,0.011580878,0.008861135,0.005315752,-0.0019940848,0.02123097,-0.010366724,0.009654623,0.0043242583,-0.008663988,0.