{"id":"386e9a18-49ee-4ffc-b64a-0d0c8b7dfe13","content":"\n\nSe la risposta non \u00e8 quella cercata, il pulsante \"Non \u00e8 la risposta\nche cercavo, contatta il supporto\" invia una email al supporto con la\ndomanda posta e la risposta ricevuta, in copia anche all'utente che l'ha\nrichiesta.\n\n13. Integrazioni API\n\nOltre al pannello, alcune operazioni sono richiamabili anche via API HTTP, per\nessere lanciate da uno scheduler esterno o da un'altra applicazione. Sono\nendpoint applicativi (non fanno parte della relazione semestrale OAM) e al\nmomento non richiedono autenticazione: sono pensati per essere chiamati solo da\nsistemi interni fidati.\n\nSincronizzazione ed email\n\nEndpointMetodoCosa fa\n\n\/api\/document-schedules\/sync-and-email\nPOST\nRicalcola lo Scadenziario documenti (stessa operazione del\npulsante \"Aggiorna scadenziario\", \u00a78) e invia via email il relativo export\nExcel (lo stesso file del pulsante \"Esporta Excel\") a\nhassistosrl@gmail.com, in copia a\npiergiuseppe.meo@gmail.com.\n\n\/api\/fornitori\/training-summary-email\nPOST\nInvia a hassistosrl@gmail","embedding":[0.009072775,0.025008235,0.011712249,-0.0025925916,0.015000415,0.0038766975,0.0166238,-0.0053134407,-0.015210476,-0.06186283,-0.0016784812,0.030305509,0.0006008553,-0.0045358604,0.008846396,1.14633185e-5,0.019752072,-0.009976714,0.017357705,0.0073803505,-0.028785491,0.0061654462,-0.0006719205,0.040971078,-0.009744285,0.01904085,0.015130739,-0.008791821,-0.020008389,0.07844004,-0.01727501,-0.008291417,-0.006084565,-0.0320599,-0.0028667282,-0.013525307,-0.008119054,0.0058824397,0.0060493057,-0.004795683,0.014167462,-0.00016713861,-0.0015214426,-0.002800576,-0.0025515524,0.0043668426,-0.007966906,-0.0115170535,0.024959536,0.0019463011,0.012421123,0.01951422,-0.015219526,0.011218346,-0.011751312,-0.0084395455,-0.006451624,-0.02715652,0.031565923,0.017636383,0.0057577384,-0.009890366,0.0077460287,0.015566944,-0.009596948,0.002025094,0.015389374,-0.008748494,0.01620147,-0.01