{"id":"d583e191-cad8-4552-8aa7-e8f84596b7b2","content":"com l'email \"Situazione formazione\nproduttori\": l'elenco dei Produttori attivi (\u00a72), in ordine alfabetico, con la\nrelativa email e il totale delle ore di formazione registrate sui documenti\ncollegati (0 se il produttore non ha documenti con ore di formazione\nvalorizzate).\n\nEntrambi gli endpoint eseguono operazioni reali (il primo ricostruisce lo\nscadenziario, come il pulsante corrispondente a pannello) e inviano email: non\nvanno richiamati per prova su dati di produzione senza necessit\u00e0.\n\nIntegrazione con UnicoBPM\n\nUnicoBPM \u00e8 un'altra applicazione della suite, che usa questi endpoint per\nleggere\/scrivere dati di UnicoOAM senza collegarsi direttamente al database:\n\nEndpointMetodoCosa fa\n\n\/api\/users\/lookup?email=.\nGET\nDato l'indirizzo email dell'utente loggato su UnicoBPM, risponde se esiste\nanche un account (con accesso al pannello) su UnicoOAM: usato dal selettore\n\"cambia applicativo\" della dashboard di UnicoBPM","embedding":[0.002440695,0.016692504,0.018055268,-0.007378346,-0.0042277016,0.006076712,0.014615142,-0.011455538,-0.012929812,-0.03887639,0.0025236923,0.025211468,-0.0010323524,0.0073148212,-0.0010797974,-0.014323259,0.0032751367,-0.009719563,-0.0020608099,-0.0078035425,-0.02777586,-0.01962734,0.0004057593,0.015381877,-0.014701165,0.02597692,0.007176417,-0.015914215,-0.022985963,0.09989329,0.003070921,-0.017233107,-0.013286631,-0.026844837,0.010449466,-0.012439506,-0.01775437,0.0135541335,0.004140457,-0.003573626,-0.0010381909,-0.01740289,-0.0047784736,-0.00615572,0.0100554805,-0.01738637,-0.0037422592,0.001994475,0.010039071,-0.019969087,0.014471464,-0.005182617,0.010209923,0.023790322,-0.012403219,0.005749599,-0.0088632805,-0.00394451,0.031996023,0.022749798,0.009863589,-0.009316397,-0.0012801293,0.016775612,-0.03897049,-0.007422421,0.015218161,-0.013001048,-2.593085e-5,-0.0009508702,0.00836768,0.047062203,0.010531508,0.026480783,-0.019511094,0.0058987387,-