{"id":"a1c1885b-9696-4810-bd60-cc6c73d491f4","content":"\n\n\/api\/models\/{model}\/fields\nGET\nElenca le colonne (con i commenti reali del database) e le relazioni di\ntipo lookup di un modello di UnicoOAM: usato da UnicoBPM per popolare la\nselezione dei campi quando si configura un processo (es. quali campi\nincludere\/escludere).\n\n\/api\/models\/{model}\/{id}\nGET\nLegge i valori di tutti i campi (le stesse colonne elencate da\n\/api\/models\/{model}\/fields) di un record esistente di UnicoOAM,\nidentificato dal suo id. Permette a UnicoBPM di leggere un record senza\nconoscere lo schema interno del database.\n\n\/api\/models\/{model}\/{id}\nPATCH\nScrive un singolo campo (field\/value nel corpo\ndella richiesta) su un record esistente di UnicoOAM. Se il campo \u00e8 una foreign\nkey verso un'altra anagrafica, il valore ricevuto viene prima risolto nel dato\neffettivo da salvare. Permette a UnicoBPM di aggiornare un record senza\nconoscere lo schema interno del database","embedding":[-0.015208852,0.015831344,0.021806166,-0.0043378654,0.010199576,0.011940861,0.014935051,-0.0020068435,0.004578485,-0.045824997,-0.014419341,-0.015393582,0.017729893,0.009508836,0.012881581,-0.02750336,-0.011524236,-0.017666286,-0.0025743837,0.011966284,-0.024852326,-0.0061381166,0.007391804,0.011343609,-0.01203202,0.018528191,0.009102959,-0.0014947975,-0.0198991,0.11159498,0.002990281,-0.012745798,0.0021627212,-0.00990107,-0.010686281,0.010815593,-0.042297974,-0.0073894504,4.6036643e-5,-0.034890465,-0.020716809,-0.01898807,-0.0006021702,0.008070363,-0.0018731002,0.0022068266,-0.018282479,0.0068426076,0.0018923278,-0.007764649,-0.0008722087,0.0058437414,0.014566177,0.018773133,0.0015570207,-0.00076118513,-0.012069972,-0.011633961,0.008414551,0.004725594,0.010139473,-0.015831996,-0.018079674,0.017872566,-0.024999116,0.011080566,0.010786986,0.00055097457,0.004734056,0.0031104237,0.011033632,0.031112768,-0.00095248036,-0.005389319,-0.009164472,0.0057942914,-0.026904915,0.00206091,-0.01