{"id":"13c90c0f-fbb1-4f7c-a4c9-8a0730d20e5d","content":"\n\nI modelli attualmente esposti da questi tre endpoint sono: fornitore\n(Produttore), cliente, employee (Dipendente) e\npratica.\n\n\/api\/models\/{model}\/{id} in PATCH scrive direttamente su un\nrecord reale: un campo o un id sbagliato nella richiesta modifica dati di\nproduzione. Come gli altri endpoint elencati in questo paragrafo, al momento\nnon richiede autenticazione: va esposto solo verso sistemi interni fidati, non\npubblicamente.\n\nControlli letti da UnicoBPM\n\nUnicoBPM, il coordinatore della suite, interroga ogni giorno lo scadenziario con due controlli (GET \/api\/checks\/{controllo}): documents:check-expired\n(documenti scaduti: regular oltre 7 giorni, warning oltre 15, alert oltre 30) e documents:check-expiring (documenti monitorati scaduti o in\nscadenza). I controlli restituiscono solo valore e grado: chi riceve l'email lo decide UnicoBPM con la RACI del passo \u00abDocumentazione\u00bb del processo Compliance (R segreteria,\nA ufficio compliance, I amministratore)","embedding":[0.006346287,0.0063466835,0.035631943,-0.0037522584,0.035480138,0.005446231,0.0018769964,-0.025513781,0.015009522,-0.036776636,-0.02036164,0.0020375235,0.013212583,0.011135648,0.029096948,-0.03026483,-0.0076262117,-0.030621817,-0.0037720185,0.022989396,-0.03508227,0.007877914,-0.0012864234,0.008888538,-0.02765025,0.030407565,0.01389064,-0.0006218589,-0.019079419,0.098236196,0.0030755505,-0.04137326,-0.010627692,-0.013586223,-0.0013240274,0.01375379,-0.03132143,-0.0033261043,0.0020912893,-0.0064056227,-0.015753513,-0.008832279,-0.0145634385,-0.01432229,0.026241899,-0.016849892,-0.018023146,0.010566082,0.0037540514,-0.010932724,0.0011075271,-0.0019488538,0.017097587,0.018422293,-0.031594273,-0.004760485,0.00065780967,-0.005428386,0.036451913,0.01424474,0.0060786265,-0.005205419,-0.0026176793,0.012756266,-0.02907476,-0.003225282,0.016838834,-0.0088396,0.012724417,-0.00040054202,0.003969447,0.048813883,0.001325534,0.0081