{"id":"42e06d64-5369-4644-a8ea-358e693fbda2","content":" Lo scadenziario si ricalcola ogni notte alle 05:30, prima dei processi di UnicoBPM.\n\n14. Glossario\n\nTermineSignificato\n\nOAMOrganismo degli Agenti e dei Mediatori: l'ente di vigilanza a cui la societ\u00e0 \u00e8 iscritta.\n\nM510Il modello di relazione semestrale richiesto dall'OAM.\n\nUnicoCoge (gi\u00e0 Proforma)Il gestionale esterno, sullo stesso server MySQL, da cui vengono importate pratiche e provvigioni (in sola lettura).\n\nPraticaUn'operazione di finanziamento seguita da un agente\/collaboratore per conto di un cliente presso un istituto erogante.\n\nErogatoL'importo effettivamente liquidato dall'istituto su una pratica.\n\nStorno \/ rivalsaRestituzione, totale o parziale, di una provvigione gi\u00e0 percepita su una pratica successivamente estinta o annullata.\n\nSOSSegnalazione di Operazione Sospetta ai fini antiriciclaggio.\n\nRUIRegistro Unico degli Intermediari assicurativi (competenza IVASS), quando la societ\u00e0 opera anche in ambito assicurativo","embedding":[0.00046660626,0.016899003,0.014636252,0.010428894,-0.0046377326,-0.003364091,0.0006621261,-0.006893981,-0.0015827843,-0.045021925,-0.017373534,0.03222746,0.008712077,0.009753902,-0.0022507054,-0.011057155,0.0117293,-0.0021554022,0.011023862,-0.017706806,-0.020021485,0.0056420974,-0.01431721,0.013423454,-0.009367577,0.02259678,0.0070030414,-0.007626656,-0.020413855,0.105985746,0.01918151,-0.011703841,-0.0057639084,-0.0288822,0.00027163557,-0.008539639,-0.037773773,-0.0044745887,0.002927522,-0.0041746935,-0.000951359,0.0061587417,0.0025763847,0.0013244759,0.015770476,0.019530356,-0.013153865,0.0047706184,-0.0015417426,-0.0067163515,0.028936476,0.026867975,-0.019321347,0.028490823,0.01086476,0.016879838,-0.0021382782,-0.008441223,0.03188634,0.008521433,0.005996613,0.0015472424,0.009059333,0.0029450778,-0.017040897,-0.014820353,0.017841702,-0.0118300365,0.024795745,0.019761361,-0.0017059719,0.033171855,0.024705403,0.015596222,-0.00894