{"id":"dcccaa91-f7fc-43cb-a0c5-95f9b91a8c05","content":"Manuale tecnico \u2014 UnicoOAM\n \n\n Manuale tecnico\n\n UnicoOAM \u2014 Laravel 13, Filament 5, pacchetto meo-icar\/unico-core. Compliance e organigramma della suite.\n\n Ruolo nella suite\nPannello e accesso\nDatabase\nModuli di compliance\nDocumenti, scadenziario e solleciti\nAssistenti AI e manuali\nSicurezza\nFatti dal codice\n\n Questo manuale descrive il codice presente in \/var\/www\/html\/unicooam. Rotte, comandi, modelli e variabili sono nell\u2019appendice Fatti dal codice, generata dal codice stesso.\n\n Ruolo nella suite\n\n UnicoOAM \u00e8 l\u2019app di compliance e organigramma del mediatore creditizio: adempimenti verso l\u2019OAM (relazione semestrale M510), registro reclami, segnalazioni di operazioni sospette, audit e piani di rimedio, documenti con scadenziario e solleciti. La risorsa Dipendenti \u00e8 l\u2019organigramma dell\u2019intera suite: chi ha un ruolo (EmployeeType) lo ha in employees.employee_roles e i permessi per ruolo stanno in EmployeeTypePermission. unicobpm, unicofinance e le altre app leggono queste definizioni","embedding":[-0.010708753,0.023010263,0.0031524692,0.006823932,-0.0038534866,-0.009590187,0.014903379,0.01064102,0.016626326,-0.053901985,-0.0057862233,0.01989217,-0.010004363,0.01442558,0.038541425,-0.017700406,0.003851993,-0.008890606,0.004075779,-0.021699479,-0.011082488,-0.0047022104,0.01849891,0.012128412,-0.017811064,0.025723036,0.0017050145,-0.0093284175,-0.038352136,0.13417311,0.0057948153,-0.013651212,-0.0008730476,-0.016378563,0.0015090099,0.004724667,-0.022039674,0.025922108,0.0012770136,-0.017047241,-0.015646439,-0.0040737973,0.0028809134,0.0041675675,0.017515088,0.006263433,-0.0067215534,-0.008588311,0.011956406,-0.0070370995,0.0108583225,0.014839003,-0.011981198,0.017553508,-0.0021758983,-0.008041497,-0.0008223208,-0.032256886,0.008836321,0.009848389,0.0091871675,-0.0073263105,0.007150376,-0.00022920745,-0.007989676,-0.041227616,0.021125926,-6.316861