{"id":"a26c4b80-d283-4274-976f-205f9c186ab5","content":"\n\n \n InterlocutoreCosa scambiaDove\n\n \n unicobpm \u2192 unicooamcontrolli dello scadenziario (GET \/api\/checks\/{comando}): documenti scaduti e in scadenza, con severityCheckStatusApiController, comandi StatusCheckCommand\n\n unicobpm \u2192 unicooamcampi di un modello e scrittura di un campo, ricerca utente per il passaggio tra appModelFieldsApiController, ModelFieldValueApiController, UserLookupApiController\n\n unicooam \u2192 unicobpmlogin automatico con token monousoBpmBridgeController (\/bpm-landing\/{subject_id})\n\n altre app \u2192 unicooamricalcolo dello scadenziario con email di riepilogo; riepilogo formazione dei produttoriDocumentScheduleSyncApiController, ProducerTrainingSummaryApiController\n\n \n \n\n Pannello e accesso\n\n Un solo pannello Filament, admin, percorso \/admin (AdminPanelProvider), con login email o Microsoft\/Google. Risorse, pagine e widget sono scoperti automaticamente in app\/Filament. Il controllo ha due livelli: il ruolo dell\u2019utente (users","embedding":[-0.0029963555,0.011182435,0.01748395,0.0039647315,-0.0008111012,-0.00040397493,0.021371817,-0.0011749914,0.007153814,-0.039856333,0.0006861212,0.0036882025,0.004267738,-0.008022192,0.01832172,-0.014533172,0.00405906,0.0003880915,0.00023896837,-0.003924793,-0.027195323,-0.008028611,0.01584777,0.0075754602,0.0045098034,0.035066515,-0.0017840174,-0.02431388,-0.033385646,0.105805784,0.0046508475,-0.0038760388,-0.0029260826,-0.012990581,0.0036703139,-0.0016772331,-0.024963237,0.010227283,-0.0014114439,0.0043704556,-0.015312597,-0.0055370936,-0.014154726,-0.023115357,0.009855861,-0.009854317,-0.0040344517,0.011670053,0.012606023,-0.0025812767,0.014165687,-0.0075163404,0.0021159153,0.0101696085,-0.011403833,-0.015979389,-0.0018415361,-0.011576744,0.014074307,0.021687662,-0.0006160875,0.00132701,-0.0007392029,0.016455013,-0.016609011,-0.016191106,0.031363077,-0.006508205,0.0061288923,-0.021774083,0.017208576,0.03881311,-0.0