{"id":"2375eee6-321f-4f13-af4d-2965ac76dda6","content":"\n\n Moduli di compliance\n\n \n ModuloModelliNote\n\n \n Relazione semestrale OAM (M510)OamPratiche, OamSemestrale, OamCode, OamArchivio, OamArchivioRigaImportPraticheService importa le pratiche del semestre nella tabella di lavoro e ricostruisce l\u2019aggregato (OamSemestraleService); lock atomico oam:import-pratiche (15 minuti), un\u2019unica transazione, cancella solo company e periodo correnti. OamArchivioService archivia e richiama un periodo. L\u2019export Excel ha i fogli Anagrafica, Profilo economico base, Prudenziale, Informativo, Sedi territoriali.\n\n Audit e rilieviAudit, AuditFinding, QualityReviewProtocollo automatico per anno (AAAA\/NNNN). QualityReviewSampler estrae un campione di pratiche e crea un audit di tipo \u00abquality\u00bb per ciascuna.\n\n Reclami e SOSComplaintRegistry, SuspiciousActivityReport, RemediationRegistro reclami, segnalazioni antiriciclaggio, piani di rimedio con scadenza e follow-up","embedding":[0.0061906474,0.027702497,0.009644491,-0.002713022,0.00835826,-0.00926223,0.009164675,0.010591591,0.0028894108,-0.0526566,-0.0153057175,0.021093307,0.009688548,-0.0049647135,0.02139848,-0.017893085,0.0098789185,0.00967712,0.0057276436,0.008575134,-0.020862583,0.016574824,0.01200741,-0.0023569746,-0.013943006,0.019108811,0.020875217,-0.0062527657,-0.022540832,0.10769919,0.004987084,-0.01815781,0.028612914,-0.01476917,-0.00414891,0.0032870388,-0.02044029,-0.014416074,0.021561703,-0.03538807,-0.003243889,0.0038084784,0.00926732,0.019980421,0.0076857232,0.01028002,-0.0014976108,0.010418481,-0.0032827007,0.011241863,0.032932177,0.016806342,-0.0018674912,0.029903814,-0.0022851587,0.0026635963,-0.01789381,0.011453728,0.02367445,0.025889235,0.018264597,-0.014764353,0.006826745,0.011389057,-0.006509274,-0.009888103,0.027334254,-0.018608388,0.017498048,-0.0037752236,-0.0054411986,0.038816527,-0.0037395477,0.0070673223,-0.013531916,-0.029285364,-0.03162894,-0.0031000208,-0.012716941,0.0305