{"id":"96d7b218-5ad8-4f88-9366-5b1dda722847","content":"\n\n Formazione e organizzazioneTrainingRecord, Organization, Employee, EmployeeTypeFormazione dei collaboratori, organismi di vigilanza, organigramma.\n\n \n \n\n Documenti, scadenziario e solleciti\n\n I documenti e i loro tipi sono del core (Unico\\Core\\Models\\Document, DocumentType, file in Media Library, stati DocumentStatus). Qui si gestiscono lo scadenziario (DocumentSchedule) e i solleciti: la logica \u00e8 nel pacchetto (Unico\\Core\\Documents\\Reminders); App\\Services\\DocumentReminderService aggiunge solo la traduzione dello stato dello scadenziario in CheckStatus per unicobpm. Il grado di un sollecito \u00e8 il peggiore tra scadenza e solleciti gi\u00e0 inviati; i template email sono scelti da EmailTemplateResolver per company, app e grado.\n\n \n ComandoEffetto\n\n \n documents:sync-scheduleRicalcola lo scadenziario (ogni notte alle 05:30, prima dei processi di unicobpm: i controlli leggono lo scadenziario com\u2019\u00e8)","embedding":[-0.004930434,0.024578607,0.010535464,-0.0062970556,-0.0052921004,-0.003253631,0.010887198,-0.009229908,0.010950113,-0.051841445,-0.004493773,0.021436531,-0.001859087,0.014431993,0.03332539,-0.030101568,0.0011487606,0.0024920192,-0.007284041,0.0008271451,-0.028321233,0.01160994,0.006120048,0.017870966,-0.015974803,0.031805426,0.009705432,-0.01257677,-0.023375995,0.10256055,0.0074645225,-0.030908484,0.0047674295,-0.026366776,-0.0035430824,0.0132678915,-0.03877861,0.012142721,0.008180239,-0.018097373,-0.019504102,-0.0005147754,-0.018089605,-0.015305188,0.00047924407,-0.01634676,-0.020532567,0.021881584,0.0063198856,-0.0054619387,0.035569835,0.0032096829,-0.007894342,0.031224947,-0.0043911403,-0.0020197397,-0.0070999153,0.012356562,0.02249071,0.0062770783,0.023229584,0.007954137,0.011622057,0.008513722,-0.034194477,-0.016931744,0.024854211,-0.020702895,0.014526881,-0.010289101,-0.0058514182,0.050850276,-0.012152884,0.008320291,-0.02712994,-0.0054006022,-0.021702264,0