{"id":"1c88cec0-60b8-415f-8c91-635c2191d6d5","content":"\n\n documents:check-expiredControllo per unicobpm: documenti scaduti; regular oltre 7 giorni, warning oltre 15, alert oltre 30. Opzione --no-sync.\n\n documents:check-expiringControllo per unicobpm: documenti monitorati scaduti o in scadenza (valore: il loro numero).\n\n documents:sync-and-emailRicalcolo e invio del riepilogo per email.\n\n oam:import-praticheImporta il semestre corrente (--year, --semester); schedulato ogni luned\u00ec alle 03:00.\n\n sharepoint:retry-uploadsRitenta i caricamenti su SharePoint rimasti in coda (UploadDocumentToSharePoint).\n\n \n \n Un controllo restituisce solo valore, severity e dettaglio (CheckStatus): a chi scrivere lo decide unicobpm con la RACI del passo, non questa app.\n\n Assistenti AI e manuali\n\n App\\Neuron\\ManualAssistantAgent \u00e8 un RAG (NeuronAI) che risponde sull\u2019uso dell\u2019app e, in sola lettura, sui dati di dominio: le tabelle interrogabili sono in lista bianca (QUERYABLE_TABLES; escluse utenti, sessioni, token e caselle email con credenziali)","embedding":[0.01956261,0.024067769,0.009042535,0.015878031,0.0043054237,0.005985916,0.022797057,-0.021252466,-0.0074630496,-0.057620432,0.010795412,0.03018006,0.0040681832,-0.010764295,0.009965293,-0.004516173,0.013136245,0.0039460044,-0.004855729,-0.0074654794,-0.027214417,0.009351248,-0.0077492157,0.016081687,-0.00570846,0.030182257,-0.0023038597,-0.0064855614,-0.026115628,0.09387531,-0.009084161,-0.023591261,-0.004199089,-0.036932334,-0.010311937,-0.0047541694,-0.02741873,-0.0019065794,0.010822185,-0.015368089,-0.010653929,-0.0024066316,0.002934298,-0.012545062,-0.010009311,-0.0049335873,0.00012358342,0.011443414,0.00649628,0.0069429,0.042644653,0.002949455,-0.016642064,0.035602085,-0.00841976,0.0061481493,0.001008902,-0.018172003,0.021413282,0.018714689,0.0022761454,-0.009179435,0.019077279,0.021932596,-0.02195109,0.004752911,0.01635875,-0.013645569,0.013601061,-0.010847721,0.006743095,0.028626643,-0.