{"id":"956ca4d7-b360-4a43-b2f5-ea9bb3e90df5","content":" DataNavigatorAgent \u00e8 una copia dell\u2019agente di daishboard: traduce domande in SELECT sulla connessione di sola lettura dbai, con il profilo di dominio scelto dal nome del database collegato. Le fonti indicizzate sono quelle di ManualAssistantAgent::manualSources() (manuale utente, manuale tecnico, CLAUDE.md) e si sincronizzano con php artisan manual:sync, da rilanciare a ogni modifica dei manuali; gli embedding passano da ProxiedGeminiEmbeddingsProvider. Le conversazioni sono salvate in ChatMessage.\n\n Non ancora utilizzabile. dbai \u00e8 una connessione dell\u2019app daishboard (config\/database.php, variabili DB_*_DBAI; il database \u00e8 fissato in codice per host, clinicaldb oppure unicosuite) e i profili stanno in config\/data_navigator.php di daishboard. In unicooam l\u2019agente \u00e8 stato copiato senza n\u00e9 la connessione n\u00e9 il file di configurazione, e nessuna pagina lo richiama","embedding":[0.0007382579,0.022928366,-0.0034197979,0.0030774162,0.0010378672,0.01337109,-0.00089600973,-0.0057872166,0.0025143165,-0.055180743,-0.013270772,0.03253189,-0.015473139,0.00040943836,0.020337071,-0.026554484,0.052765086,-0.008924747,-0.012639827,-0.011366551,0.0043656738,0.014766129,-0.009806892,0.033120945,0.004176284,0.035377342,0.005978394,0.003938282,-0.009608073,0.117962934,-0.0146802515,-0.009481644,0.021027459,-0.015724575,0.007389594,-0.003830295,-0.0019660727,0.005393387,0.027813172,-0.010214064,0.0068750223,0.0024790931,0.004658681,0.009315471,-0.001288595,0.0003975299,0.0005047683,-0.0047652186,-0.004172177,0.005922225,-0.0019164693,0.015746435,-0.0028976528,0.0032373706,0.0007515114,0.0036401823,0.00743573,-0.008909537,-0.00643677,0.025297416,0.0004319901,-0.010185019,-0.010707334,-0.008235257,0.0042542666,0.00043672262,0.028203068,-0.01553464,0.014821631,-0.0029851464,0.004037851,0.00095268886,-0.014480533,0.01176995,-0.009535102,-0.023148488,-0.03698313,0.011149682,-0.01564712,0.0