{"id":"9834bfa0-5b0d-4e7c-9b89-f38319e7a5ce","content":" Per usarlo servono la connessione dbai (di sola lettura, su unicosuite), un profilo per il dominio compliance e il collegamento a una pagina.\n\n Sicurezza\n\n API senza autenticazione. Le rotte di routes\/api.php (modelli, ricerca utente, controlli, \/api\/document-schedules\/sync-and-email, \/api\/fornitori\/training-summary-email) non hanno nessun middleware di autenticazione (\u00abambiente non di produzione\u00bb): le ultime due ricalcolano lo scadenziario e inviano email. In unicofinance e unicocoge le stesse rotte sono dietro X-Api-Key (VerifyBridgeKey \/ bpm.auth): vanno protette allo stesso modo prima del rilascio.\n\n Chiavi e password solo nel .env, mai nel codice o nei log. Le caselle email (MailAccount) contengono credenziali: non sono interrogabili dall\u2019assistente. Il download dei documenti passa da DocumentDownloadController (\/documents\/{document}\/download) con controllo di accesso.\n\n \nFatti dal codice\n\nSezione generata da unico-core\/tools\/manuals\/gen_facts","embedding":[0.01544096,0.027358782,0.010041768,-0.01710536,0.010265817,0.0023587993,-0.005502043,-0.0018920066,0.001942647,-0.042962242,-0.009956948,0.024678204,-0.007651719,0.009015436,0.019763965,-0.023859406,-0.0025189645,-0.01002291,-0.0004575457,-0.0013477434,-0.033257447,0.010968285,0.0039270273,0.02301141,-0.008302741,0.026533471,-0.00450261,-0.019255318,-0.033053655,0.081832215,-0.00037399604,-0.025469549,0.014383362,-0.010442687,-0.011340024,-0.0038620438,-0.0076948116,0.005302385,0.014748805,-0.007013793,0.0026132413,0.011188512,-0.022199394,-0.008539211,0.025400018,-0.0031860853,-0.005305034,0.005406294,-0.00062865,0.0011704228,0.019704785,-0.0025166604,-0.01097546,0.015530686,-0.021157857,-0.0091072405,-0.0055081653,-0.016582852,0.02439221,0.0022381707,0.0067845066,-0.004030413,0.0005169837,0.0017605391,-0.0068845707,-0.005361016,0.033832245,-0.009793322,0.020581534,0.0032962852,-0.0019128614,0.034469318,0.007960